rs may process data where needed to operate the site.</p></section><section><h2>How long we retain data</h2><p>Comments and metadata may be retained indefinitely to recognise follow-up comments. Registered-user profile information may be stored while an account exists; users can view, edit or delete most profile information, and administrators may manage it.</p></section><section><h2>Your rights</h2><p>Account holders and commenters may request an export of personal data and may ask for erasure, except for information that must be kept for administrative, legal or security purposes.</p></section><section><h2>Where data is sent</h2><p>Visitor comments may be checked through an automated spam-detection service.</p></section><section><h2>Contact</h2><p>Email <a href="mailto:info@thelearningnet.org">info@thelearningnet.org</a> with privacy questions.</p></section>',
