en permission.</p></section><section><h2>6. Limitation of liability</h2><p>We aim to provide high-quality educational services but do not guarantee specific academic results. We are not responsible for loss of data, service interruption, technical issues, third-party conduct or decisions based on website information.</p></section><section><h2>7. Privacy</h2><p>Personal information is handled under our Privacy and Data Protection policies.</p></section><section><h2>8. Third-party links</h2><p>We are not responsible for the content, privacy policies or practices of third-party websites linked from this site.</p></section><section><h2>9. Changes</h2><p>These terms may be updated and posted on this website. Continued use after an update constitutes acceptance.</p></section><section><h2>10. Governing law and jurisdiction</h2><p>These terms are governed by the laws of England and Wales. Disputes are subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of England and Wales.</p></section><section><h2>11. Contact</h2><p>Email <a href="mailto:info@thelearningnet.org">info@thelearningnet.org</a> with questions.</p></section>',
